--- hop --doctor ---

install
  version                1.0.0 (abc1234)
  method                 checkout at /src/hop
  binary                 /src/hop/bin/hop
  shell                  zsh, but its integration predates this hop: run 'exec zsh'

config
  HOP_CONFIG             ~/.config/hop/config.toml (default, readable)
  HOP_WORKSPACES_FILE    ~/.config/hop/workspaces (default, readable)
  HOP_HISTFILE           ~/.local/state/hop/history (default, MISSING)
  HOP_HIST_MAX           50 (config)
  HOP_DEFAULT_KINDS      unset, so each kind's own default
  HOP_VIM                on (default)
  HOP_ACTION             bogus (env), so Enter cds
  HOP_JUMP               auto (default)
  HOP_CODE               ~/bin/code (env)
  VS Code reachable      no, ~/bin/code is not runnable
  HOP_CLIPBOARD          unset, so the first of pbcopy, wl-copy, xclip, xsel, clip.exe
  HOP_FZF_HEIGHT         80% (default)
  HOP_HOPRC              unset
  HOP_REPOS              unset, derived from workspaces
  HOP_DEBUG              unset
  HOP_DEBUG_LOG          ~/.local/state/hop/debug.log (default, readable)

tools
  fzf      0.60.3 (stub)
  git      git version 2.0.0 (stub)
  gh       gh version 2.0.0 (stub)
  bat      bat 0.24.0
  code     1.100.0
  zsh      NOT INSTALLED

terminal
  TERM                   xterm-test
  COLUMNS                100
  completions            loaded by hop init zsh

where you are
  PWD                    ~/code/repo
  git toplevel           ~/code/repo
  workspace for PWD      ~/code

workspaces
  zzsentinelws           ~/code

kinds, with row counts here
  * zzsentinelkind       1  dirs     the sentinel
    dir               4  builtin  repo root and top-level dirs
  (* is in the default set)
  recipes available: dir project file
  recipes loaded:    none

keys people mix up
  l / ctrl-l    go INTO the thing under the cursor (workspace -> repos -> targets)
  h / ctrl-h    come back OUT a level
  b / alt-B     open on your git host, NOT navigation
  ^G / alt-g    launch hop from the shell prompt

last 15 debug lines (~/.local/state/hop/debug.log)
  2026-10-19T10:00:00 pick label=repo rows=3 query= st=0
  2026-10-19T10:00:01 dispatch key=enter dir=~/code/repo/alpha preview= rel=alpha
--- end ---
